        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LMrTOW6nH9IcZZdsv8Me-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;阴影&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;shadow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="180" x="2999.6699999999996" y="4297" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LMrTOW6nH9IcZZdsv8Me-5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;点阴影point shadow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;（适用于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;点光源&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="180" x="3392.87" y="5340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LMrTOW6nH9IcZZdsv8Me-8" edge="1" parent="1" source="LMrTOW6nH9IcZZdsv8Me-7" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;" target="Il875BkISgsyEV4rqZKW-5">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LMrTOW6nH9IcZZdsv8Me-7" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 244, 246), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;从光的角度考虑：物体表面如何被照亮为完全平坦的表面？答案是由于物体表面的法向量&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 244, 246));&quot;&gt;从照明技术的角度来看，它决定物体形状的&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;唯一方法&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 244, 246));&quot;&gt;是通过它的垂直法向量&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 244, 246));&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;通过使用每个片段的法线，我们可以欺骗照明，让它相信一个表面是由微小的平面（垂直于法线向量）组成的&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="810" x="3232.35" y="5720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LMrTOW6nH9IcZZdsv8Me-9" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(170, 201, 160);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(84, 79, 72), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;只改变每个片段的法向量，所以不需要改变照明方程（&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(24, 26, 27); color: rgb(232, 230, 227); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;每个顶点只有一条法线&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(170, 201, 160), rgb(54, 81, 45)); font-size: 14px; color: light-dark(rgb(84, 79, 72), rgb(172, 168, 162)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="380" x="3246.1" y="5790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="5TdQqByTQvm9FEfxZIQ--5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=379;entryDy=55;entryPerimeter=0;" target="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-6" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="888.5500000000002" x="3307.87" y="-5260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-1" parent="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-6" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;三角形的法线&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt; 是长度为 1 的向量，与该三角形垂直。通过取其两条边的叉积（a 和 b 的叉积产生一个与 a 和 b 都垂直的向量），然后归一化，即可轻松计算法线：其长度恢复为 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="379" x="9.550000000000182" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-3" parent="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-6" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;顶点法线&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt; 是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;周围三角形法线的组合&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="353" x="388.5500000000002" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-4" parent="2LxfDStiluzhHC5bgg7s-6" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
