        <mxCell id="Vk2pX9wyjKoTmjqXzQ-a-72" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;片段着色器处理完片段后，会执行模板测试(模板测试也可以丢弃片段) 之后，剩余的片段会传递给深度测试&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;主要用于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;自定义&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;stencil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;缓冲区&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;决定丢弃或传递某些&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;fragment&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;和&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;考虑展现object outlining（&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;对象轮廓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;）功能（展示一种选中、高亮的效果）及其他；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
