        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#dc7e2b&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;纹理坐标不依赖于分辨率，可以是任何浮点值，因此 OpenGL 需确定将纹理坐标映射到哪个纹理像素（纹素）。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#dc7e2b&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;因为会出现纹理的分辨率和屏幕显示的大小不一致，需要进行插值计算！！！&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="830" x="5920" y="-4825" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-22" edge="1" parent="1" source="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-21">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-16" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Mipmaps&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="150" x="5710" y="-4605" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-19" edge="1" parent="1" source="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-18" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;" target="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-16">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ba6922&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;为了解决纹理在远距离或小尺寸显示时出现的视觉瑕疵问题；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ba6922&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;而且小物体上使用高分辨率纹理还会浪费内存带宽；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;mipmap 本质上是一系列纹理图像的集合，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;当物体距离观察者超过一定距离阈值后，OpenGL 会使用最适合该距离的 mipmap 纹理&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="970" x="5910" y="-4680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-20" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;纹理单元&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Texture Units&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="150" x="5570" y="-4420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-21" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;问题&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="80" x="5960" y="-4488" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-24" edge="1" parent="1" source="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-23" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;" target="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-21">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-23" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(196, 126, 65), rgb(255, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;在 OpenGL 渲染过程中切换 mipmaps level时，可能会出现一些瑕疵，eg:两个 mipmap 层之间出现明显的锐利边缘。与普通纹理过滤类似&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1030" x="6059" y="-4460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-27" edge="1" parent="1" source="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-26" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;" target="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-20">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7D1LSCoktzJo83gK7ooD-26" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(186, 105, 34), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;主要目的是允许我们在着色器中使用多个纹理。通过将纹理单元分配给采样器&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(171, 111, 59); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;sampler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(186, 105, 34), rgb(255, 0, 0)); font-size: 16px; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;，只要我们先激活相应的纹理单元，就可以同时绑定到多个纹理；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ba6922&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c47e41&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;既然我们没有用 glUniform 给 sampler2D 变量赋值，为什么它还是一个 uniform 变量（暗示不用的话会被编译器删除）。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c47e41&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;因为使用 glUniform1i 我们可以给纹理采样器sampler分配一个位置值，这样就可以在片段fragment着色器中一次设置多个纹理。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c47e41&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;纹理的这个位置通常被称为纹理单元。纹理的默认纹理单元是 0 （默认的活动纹理单元）；需要注意的是，并非所有图形驱动程序都会分配默认纹理单元&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="1120" x="5900" y="-4380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
