ot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;在视图空间&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;view space&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;中的Z值可以是投影平截头体的&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot; data-immersive-translate-walked=&quot;a76a9a8e-cac6-49c0-b6a6-b67c24305a06&quot;&gt;near&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;和&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot; data-immersive-translate-walked=&quot;a76a9a8e-cac6-49c0-b6a6-b67c24305a06&quot;&gt;far&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;平面之间的任何值。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;需要将这些视图空间z值转换为&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-immersive-translate-walked=&quot;a76a9a8e-cac6-49c0-b6a6-b67c24305a06&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; font-size: 16p