        <mxCell id="xUe7s8qEhq_bIf-PJ3Zu-3" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;glm::mat4 lightSpaceMatrix = lightProjection&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;(模拟&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;定向光源，所有光线都是平行的。使用正交投影矩阵&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt; * lightView&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); font-family: Gudea, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;glm::lookAt() [光源角度 ]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0)); background-color: transparent; font-family: Gudea, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;);&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot; face=&quot;Gudea, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;透视投影最适用于具有实际位置的光源，这与方向光不同。透视投影最常用于聚光灯和点光源，而正交投影则用于方向光。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
